2026-03-27: Lev02 (Grain Offering) - Insight on Salt as God's Faithfulness (prevenient grace) and Yeast/Honey as human pretense/masking.
- Goal: Authenticity (no puffing/masking) and reliance on Covenant (salt).
- Dialogue with Guareschi: Clarified that God doesn't hate materials (yeast/honey), but their 'swelling' and 'masking' nature when used by humans to manipulate spiritual perceptions.

2026-06-03: Lev03 (Peace Offering) - Insight on Peace Offering being laid "upon the burnt offering" as a structural priority (번제 후 화목제).
- Goal: Recognizing that true covenantal fellowship/communion (Shalom) cannot bypass complete self-surrender and atonement (Olah).
- Dialogue with Guareschi: Validated that there is no peace offering without a burnt offering, protecting horizontal peace from degenerating into human-centered moralizing or cheap fellowship.
